    {
      "displayText": "매번 같은 말을 하는 것 같지만,\n나는 컬러 콘택트렌즈를<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n디자인하고 있어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9E4BC880020AC19C7400020B9D0C7440020D558B2940020AC830020AC19C9C0B9CC002C000AB098B2940020CEECB7EC0020CF58D0DDD2B8B80CC988B97C00100001BE00000AB514C790C778D558ACE00020C788C5B4002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지난번에 손님한테서 들은 건데,\n요가램은 요가를 수행하고 있다더라고.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n정말 대단하지 않아?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0B09CBC88C5D00020C190B2D8D55CD14CC11C0020B4E4C7400020AC74B370002C000AC694AC00B7A8C7400020C694AC00B97C0020C218D589D558ACE00020C788B2E4B354B77CACE0002E00100001BE00000AC815B9D00020B300B2E8D558C9C00020C54AC544003F00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런 요가램이 메가진화를 한다면...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F00020C694AC00B7A8C7740020BA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020D55CB2E4BA74002E002E002E00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...요가진화?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EC694AC00C9C4D654003F00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아~ 궁금해!\n메가요가램을 이 눈으로 꼭 한번 봤으면!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544007E0020AD81AE08D5740021000ABA54AC00C694AC00B7A8C7440020C7740020B208C73CB85C0020AF2D0020D55CBC880020BD24C73CBA740021002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마지막 승부로\n요가램의 메가진화를 내게 보여 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8C9C0B9C90020C2B9BD80B85C000AC694AC00B7A8C7580020BA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020B0B4AC8C0020BCF4C5EC0020C918002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "참고로 요가램의 메가스톤은\n스톤숍에서 팔고 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
