      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 하면 몬스터볼!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020D558BA740020BAACC2A4D130BCFC002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "박스 하면 사이버!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC15C2A40020D558BA740020C0ACC774BC84002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르의 컬러 콘택트렌즈 팬들에게\n새로운 세계를 보여 줄 준비가 끝났어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C7580020CEECB7EC0020CF58D0DDD2B8B80CC9880020D32CB4E4C5D0AC8C000AC0C8B85CC6B40020C138ACC4B97C0020BCF4C5EC0020C9040020C900BE44AC000020B05DB0ACC5B4002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컬러 콘택트렌즈에\n몬스터볼과 사이버가 추가되었다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
